        "acc_1": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How It Works",
            "body": "<p>Pick your bundle (1, 2, or 3 pairs), choose color and US size for each pair, and add to cart. We ship from our warehouse with tracking. Cushioned insoles and balanced heels are built for real miles — commute, desk, and evening.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_2": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Materials & Care",
            "body": "<p>Full-grain leather, suede, and lined uppers selected for durability and comfort. Wipe with a soft cloth, use a brush on suede, and store with shoe trees when you can. Avoid prolonged soaking; let wet shoes air-dry away from direct heat.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_3": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Size & Fit",
            "body": "<p>US sizes 5–12 on most styles. Use the Size Guide above and measure foot length for the best match. Between sizes? Size up for a roomier toe box. Wrong fit? Free exchange — we help you swap sizes quickly.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_4": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping & Returns",
            "body": "<p>Ships in 2–3 business days, fully tracked. You have 90 days to wear them in: if they are not the pair you reach for every day, contact us for a full refund. Exchanges for size are always free.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_5": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Common Questions",
            "body": "<p><strong>True to size?</strong> Yes — most customers order their usual US size. <strong>All-day comfort?</strong> Cushioned footbed and stable heel balance are designed for long wear. <strong>Break-in?</strong> Leather softens within a few wears; start with shorter outings if needed.</p>"
          }
        },
